{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54763","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星昼陨，其地定爲灾（京本作「其下地殃危」）。\n必有火焚军寨栅，兼防将士涉沙泥（京本作「垝」），移寨（京本作「去」）莫徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}